[{"client_msg_id":"b90db18a-0a4d-4301-b0c0-f4fee7d9e83b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶんRuby パッチとかgemのやつみたいなのも考えてなんだろうな","ts":"1628246981.171700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bc4d2b5-a3be-4540-9cb0-f4fb20f69c7a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"今あらためて読んでみたらFSFは300行未満の重要でない小さなコードにはApache License 2.0がおすすめのようです。\n\u003chttps://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.ja.html#WhatIfWorkIsShort\u003e\n\u0026gt; 著作物がライセンス自身よりもそんなに長くない場合はどうしたらよいですか? (#WhatIfWorkIsShort)\n\u0026gt; もし全体のソフトウェアパッケージがそんなに小さいコードしかない(300行がわたしたちの使う基準です)短いならば、GNU GPLのようなコピーレフトのライセンスではなく、より緩い寛容なライセンスを適用したほうが良いでしょう。(そのコードが特に重要でなければ。) わたしたちは、そのような場合、Apache ライセンス2.0を推奨します。","ts":"1628245487.171100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eZUW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a07b6ebc-09a5-46f5-a52a-abd1cd91b822","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"おまえのものはみんなのもの、おれのものもみんなのもの","ts":"1628245015.168800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2iTA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3e7c9c2-1d9e-432f-a118-899663f39000","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"特にGPLについては良く話題になるので、ここを一読しておくと積極的に間違ったことを発信してしまうという事故は防げそう。（もう読まれてるかもしれませんが）\n\u003chttps://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.ja.html\u003e","ts":"1628244951.168500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"24F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a91f1c52-5e7b-406b-9e7a-5b2d7c824530","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おそらく誰も分からない。。（法律の専門家ではないので）　俺たちは雰囲気で...(ry","ts":"1628244799.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2scl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0635bd61-2c7e-449a-8d59-e123bba3a309","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実際の所ライセンスなんもわからんので誰かに教えてもらいたさある","ts":"1628244729.165500","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1628244761.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"csJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"717309d2-afbd-4759-8c0c-1770a059e1d0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~Q. ソフトウェアライセンスとは何ですか？~\n~A. なぜかリポジトリトップに置いてあったりソースコードに埋め込まれていたりする謎の文言。みんなに使ってもらうためには付けないといけないとされている~","ts":"1628244717.165200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YA9N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feb8071e-40b2-4178-93d4-efc30ef0ac00","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"改めて読むと\n\u0026gt; Q. ソフトウェアライセンスとは何ですか？\n\u0026gt; A. 開発者からユーザに対する、「そのソフトウェアを使ってもよい」という許可のことです。\nこの冒頭のQ\u0026amp;Aすごいこと書いてあるな。。","ts":"1628244585.163800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KWgoq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb55690-f5ca-4be4-bd5f-4ebd52f8eff4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://kimiyuki.net/blog/2020/02/14/licenses-for-kyopro-libraries/\u003e\n知らないというわけではないと思います。先頭で紹介されてますし。\nただ、CC0の章の中で\n\n\u0026gt; 注意: 形式ばらないライセンスはやめておけ\nという章があり、あたかもCC0が「形式ばらないライセンス」であり、やめておいたほうが良いと誤読してしまいそうなのは残念ですね。","ts":"1628244458.162700","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1628244522.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5Qzy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95756355-2a19-43d5-a73b-a5c4c539f3f0","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"AtCoder Library も CC0 だし、競プロやってて知らないはずはないと思うのだけどなあ。","ts":"1628243250.160400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BLx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fd9ef91-1c48-468e-b05f-57b783507a79","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。:kanzen_rikai:","ts":"1628240138.159300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v03t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67d7ef51-4d28-4ae5-bfe9-dd4eb32891ab","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"他の著作権ライセンスもつまるところ「法で制定された著作権とは違う形での利用を、このライセンスによって保証します。原本の著作物は著作権があり、その制約とともに自分から動くことはないで大丈夫です」が大枠といえるかな?","ts":"1628239753.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5HWi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69ced4ef-fc51-4cf9-ab34-2d5548376400","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"完全に気分の問題だけど、Boost License は C++ 以外に使いづらい…","ts":"1628239300.157000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rG8jx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"154e2a45-d65f-4a25-a43b-1afa0288dd9a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なので著作権を保持したまま、権限を行使しないよというライセンスを発行し、それをもって契約する形になると...","ts":"1628239285.156800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SpX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c4bcb82-87a0-40c0-ace9-525faad90e8a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.star-law.jp/news/post-632.html\u003e\n\u0026gt; 著作権法上，著作権を放棄する場合の手続は定められていません。\n法律むずい。。","ts":"1628239246.155800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eyff0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f8425ee-775c-4a4f-8ee0-ffddb6cce1ed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"PDを宣言するのが、結構やっかいだからだろうね(全世界の著作権とすりあわせを進めてあるという意味で有用)","ts":"1628239148.155300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2SOGp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cd3ce35-3e27-4757-a78b-bbf52e927d40","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.gnu.org/licenses/licens